cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "phytolaeno"
abstract: >
  phytolaeno is a web portal for storing, browsing, and comparing plant genome
  annotation data. Built with FastAPI and PostgreSQL, it provides a REST API
  and interactive interface for managing gene models, repeat annotations, and
  QC metrics across multiple species. Named after Phytolacca (pokeweed) + laeno
  (web/network).
